[I] Grow bonsai trees in your terminal

[T] cbonsai is a bonsai tree generator written in C using ncurses. It
[T] intelligently creates, colors and positions a bonsai tree, is entirely
[T] configurable via command line options and can grow the tree live or act
[T] as a screensaver.

[U] https://gitlab.com/jallbrit/cbonsai

[A] Cbonsai Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

